'''Lightning Aegis''' is a [[skill]] that applies a protective [[buff]] on the character and absorbs [[lightning damage]] from [[hit]]s up to a certain amount before it temporarily dissipates.

==Acquisition==
Lightning Aegis can only be obtained by equipping {{il|Perepiteia}}.

